# Media proxy configuration (server-side only).
#
# The Express server proxies catalog and playback metadata from a
# self-hosted MovieBox-compatible media worker (the reference API is the
# "Spün MovieBox API" Cloudflare Worker — https://github.com/heisdanny64/spun-moviebox-api).
# Set these in your shell or environment file before starting the server:
#
#   MEDIA_API_BASE_URL=https://your-worker.workers.dev
#   MEDIA_API_SECRET=your-worker-secret
#
# Requirements:
#   - MEDIA_API_BASE_URL is the worker root URL. The proxy appends the
#     worker's root-level routes (/home, /search, /info/:subjectId,
#     /season/:subjectId, /stream/:subjectId) — do NOT add an /api/v1
#     prefix; the worker does not serve one.
#   - MEDIA_API_SECRET must match the secret the worker operator configured
#     as its auth secret (MOVIEBOX_SECRET on the reference worker). It is
#     sent as the X-Worker-Secret header and never leaves this server.
#
# When unset, the server still runs but media endpoints respond with
# 503 MEDIA_NOT_CONFIGURED. Credentials never reach the browser.
#
# Quick verification once configured:
#   curl -s http://localhost:4000/api/v1/health
#   curl -s http://localhost:4000/api/v1/media/home
MEDIA_API_BASE_URL=
MEDIA_API_SECRET=